n class="line">128</span><br><span class="line">129</span><br><span class="line">130</span><br><span class="line">131</span><br><span class="line">132</span><br><span class="line">133</span><br><span class="line">134</span><br><span class="line">135</span><br><span class="line">136</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bibtex">% === 生物监测与毒素负荷 ===<br><br>@misc&#123;ewg2005bodyburden,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Environmental Working Group&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Body Burden: The Pollution in Newborns&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2005&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.ewg.org/research/body-burden-pollution-newborns&#125;,<br>  note = &#123;Benchmark biomonitoring study finding 200 industrial chemicals in umbilical cord blood&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@article&#123;cdc2001exposure,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Centers for Disease Control and Prevention&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;National Report on Human Exposure to Environmental Chemicals&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2001&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.cdc.gov/exposurereport/pdf/reportsummary2001.pdf&#125;,<br>  note = &#123;First national biomonitoring report&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>% === 内分泌干扰物 ===<br><br>@article&#123;who2013edcs,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;WHO&#125; and &#123;&#123;United Nations Environment Programme&#125;&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;State of the Science of Endocrine Disrupting Chemicals&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2013&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/state-of-the-science-of-endocrine-disrupting-chemicals&#125;,<br>  note = &#123;WHO/UNEP joint report identifying EDCs as global health threat&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@article&#123;gore2015endocrine,<br>  author = &#123;Gore, A.C. and Chappell, V.A. and Fenton, S.E. and Flaws, J.A. and Nadal, A. and Prins, G.S. and Toppari, J. and Zoeller, R.T.&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;EDC-2: The Endocrine Society&#x27;s Second Scientific Statement on Endocrine-Disrupting Chemicals&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;Endocrine Reviews&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2015&#125;,<br>  volume = &#123;36&#125;,<br>  number = &#123;1&#125;,<br>  pages = &#123;E1--E150&#125;,<br>  doi = &#123;10.1210/er.2015-1010&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>% === 表观遗传跨代传承 ===<br><br>@article&#123;answay2005vinclozolin,<br>  author = &#123;Anway, M.D. and Cupp, A.S. and Uzumcu, M. and Skinner, M.K.&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Epigenetic Transgenerational Inheritance of Adult-Onset Disease Sperm Epigenetic Marks Following Vinclozolin Exposure&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;Science&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2005&#125;,<br>  volume = &#123;308&#125;,<br>  number = &#123;5727&#125;,<br>  pages = &#123;1466--1469&#125;,<br>  doi = &#123;10.1126/science.1109194&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@article&#123;skinner2016epigenetic,<br>  author = &#123;Skinner, M.K.&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Epigenetic Transgenerational Inheritance of Disease: Ancestral Exposures and Disease Susceptibility&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;Nature Reviews Genetics&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2016&#125;,<br>  volume = &#123;17&#125;,<br>  pages = &#123;92--104&#125;,<br>  doi = &#123;10.1038/nrg.2015.22&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41576-022-00492-0&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@article&#123;ncbi2020toxins,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;NCBI&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Environmental Toxins and Epigenetic Inheritance&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;PMC&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2020&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7240565/&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>% === 异生素代谢与氧化应激 ===<br><br>@article&#123;biomedicines2024xenobiotic,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Multiple Authors&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Xenobiotic Metabolism, Oxidative Stress, and Liver Disease&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;Biomedicines&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2024&#125;,<br>  volume = &#123;12&#125;,<br>  number = &#123;8&#125;,<br>  pages = &#123;1795&#125;,<br>  doi = &#123;10.3390/biomedicines12081795&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.mdpi.com/2227-9059/12/8/1795&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@article&#123;frontiers2022liver,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Multiple Authors&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Role of Oxidative Stress in Xenobiotic-Induced Liver Toxicity&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;Frontiers in Physiology&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2022&#125;,<br>  doi = &#123;10.3389/fphys.2022.986685&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fphys.2022.986685/full&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@article&#123;nature2019nrf2,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Multiple Authors&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Nrf2 Signaling in Liver Disease&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;Nature Reviews Gastroenterology \&amp; Hepatology&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2019&#125;,<br>  doi = &#123;10.1038/s41575-019-0197-1&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>% === 谷胱甘肽与临床研究 ===<br><br>@article&#123;ncbi2022detox,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;NCBI&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Detoxification in Clinical Practice: What Do We Know?&#125;,<br>  booktitle = &#123;Nutritional and Integrative Strategies in Cardiovascular Medicine&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2022&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK570573/&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@article&#123;sage2012nutrition,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Multiple Authors&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Nutrition in Clinical Practice: The Role of Functional Foods and Detoxification&#125;,<br>  journal = &#123;Nutrition in Clinical Practice&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2012&#125;,<br>  doi = &#123;10.1177/0884533612456124&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>% === 功能医学临床实践 ===<br><br>@misc&#123;ifm2024detox,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Institute for Functional Medicine&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;Functional Medicine Approaches to Detoxification&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2024&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://practice.ifm.org/functional-medicine-approaches-to-detoxification&#125;,<br>  note = &#123;Clinical practice platform with detoxification modules and case studies&#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>@misc&#123;rupa2024detox,<br>  author = &#123;&#123;Rupa Health&#125;&#125;,<br>  title = &#123;The Detoxification System: A Functional Medicine Approach to Clinical Practice&#125;,<br>  year = &#123;2024&#125;,<br>  url = &#123;https://www.rupahealth.com/post/the-detoxification-system-a-functional-medicine-approach-to-clinical-practice&#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="七、参考文献来源"><a href="#七、参考文献来源" class="headerlink" title="七、参考文献来源"></a>七、参考文献来源</h2><h3 id="主要检索来源"><a href="#主要检索来源" class="headerlink" title="主要检索来源"></a>主要检索来源</h3><ol><li><a href="https://www.ewg.org/research/body-burden-pollution-newborns">EWG Body Burden Research</a> - 新生儿污染物研究</li><li><a href="https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/state-of-the-science-of-endocrine-disrupting-chemicals">WHO&#x2F;UNEP EDCs Report</a> - 内分泌干扰物报告</li><li><a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41576-022-00492-0">Nature Reviews Genetics</a> - 表观遗传跨代传承综述</li><li><a href="https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.1109194">Science - Vinclozolin Study</a> - vinclozolin跨代遗传研究</li><li><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7240565/">NCBI PMC</a> - 环境毒素与表观遗传</li><li><a href="https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/fphys.2022.986685/full">Frontiers in Physiology</a> - 异生素诱导肝毒性</li><li><a href="https://www.mdpi.com/2227-9059/12/8/1795">Biomedicines</a> - 异生素代谢与氧化应激</li><li><a href="https://practice.ifm.org/functional-medicine-approaches-to-detoxification">IFM Practice Platform</a> - 功能医学解毒临床课程</li><li><a href="https://www.rupahealth.com/post/the-detoxification-system-a-functional-medicine-approach-to-clinical-practice">Rupa Health Guide</a> - 解毒系统指南</li><li><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK570573/">NCBI Books</a> - 临床实践解毒证据</li></ol><hr><h2 id="八、检索策略说明"><a href="#八、检索策略说明" class="headerlink" title="八、检索策略说明"></a>八、检索策略说明</h2><p><strong>检索数据库</strong>: Google Scholar, PubMed, NCBI PMC, Nature, Science Direct, Frontiers</p><p><strong>检索关键词组合</strong>:</p><ul><li>“functional medicine toxin theory disease”</li><li>“environmental toxins chronic disease mechanism”</li><li>“endocrine disrupting chemicals EDCs health effects”</li><li>“xenobiotics biotransformation liver disease oxidative stress”</li><li>“heavy metals neurodegenerative disease Alzheimer Parkinson”</li><li>“glutathione detoxification chronic disease clinical trial”</li><li>“epigenetic transgenerational inheritance toxin exposure”</li><li>“mycotoxins health effects chronic illness”</li><li>“Nrf2 pathway detoxification sulforaphane”</li><li>“body burden biomonitoring EWG”</li></ul><p><strong>时间范围</strong>: 重点检索2020-2024年文献，包含经典里程碑研究（2005-2015）</p><hr><p><em>本文献综述由 citation-management skill 生成，遵循系统性文献检索与元数据提取规范。</em><section class="footnotes"><div class="footnote-list"><ol><li><span id="fn:2" class="footnote-text"><span><table></p><thead><tr><th>健康领域</th><th>具体影响</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>生殖健康</strong></td><td>不孕不育、生殖道异常、青春期发育异常、多囊卵巢综合征</td></tr><tr><td><strong>代谢疾病</strong></td><td>肥胖、代谢综合征、2型糖尿病、甲状腺功能异常</td></tr><tr><td><strong>发育影响</strong></td><td>神经发育障碍（ADHD、自闭症）、认知行为缺陷、出生缺陷</td></tr><tr><td><strong>癌症</strong></td><td>乳腺癌、前列腺癌、睾丸癌、甲状腺癌</td></tr><tr><td><strong>其他</strong></td><td>心血管疾病、免疫系统功能障碍、肝肾疾病</td></tr></tbody></table><a href="#fnref:2" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:4" class="footnote-text"><span><strong>代谢阶段</strong>:<ol><li><strong>Phase I（功能化）</strong>: CYP450酶系统进行氧化&#x2F;还原&#x2F;水解，产生活性氧（ROS）</li><li><strong>Phase II（结合）</strong>: 与谷胱甘肽、葡萄糖醛酸、硫酸结合，增加水溶性</li><li><strong>Phase III（消除）</strong>: 转运蛋白将结合物排出细胞</li></ol><a href="#fnref:4" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:5" class="footnote-text"><span><ul><li>ROS过量产生导致抗氧化防御失衡</li><li>肝损伤、炎症、纤维化、癌变的关键驱动因素</li><li>脂质过氧化、DNA损伤、蛋白质修饰、星状细胞激活导致纤维化</li></ul><a href="#fnref:5" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:8" class="footnote-text"><span><strong>关键发现</strong>:<ul><li>环境毒素可诱导DNA甲基化、组蛋白修饰、非编码RNA表达变化</li><li>这些表观遗传改变可跨代传递，影响未直接暴露的后代疾病易感性</li></ul><a href="#fnref:8" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:11" class="footnote-text"><span><strong>临床研究发现</strong>:<ul><li><strong>帕金森病临床试验</strong>: IV谷胱甘肽可改善运动症状和生活质量</li><li><strong>慢性肝病</strong>: NAC（N-乙酰半胱氨酸）FDA批准用于对乙酰氨基酚过量</li><li><strong>心血管疾病</strong>: 谷胱甘肽减少内皮细胞氧化应激</li></ul><a href="#fnref:11" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:12" class="footnote-text"><span><strong>评估维度</strong>:<ul><li>环境毒素检测</li><li>解毒能力&#x2F;功能检测</li><li>影响解毒通路的基因多态性</li><li>肝功能评估</li></ul><a href="#fnref:12" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:13" class="footnote-text"><span><ul><li>现代环境显著增加了毒素暴露</li><li>毒素累积超过解毒能力导致生理功能障碍或疾病</li><li>营养干预可支持天然解毒过程</li></ul><a href="#fnref:13" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li><li><span id="fn:14" class="footnote-text"><span><ul><li>多种低剂量暴露的累积效应</li><li>个体解毒能力差异决定敏感性</li><li>基因多态性影响代谢酶活性</li></ul><a href="#fnref:14" rev="footnote" class="footnote-backref"> ↩</a></span></span></li></ol></div></section>]]></content>
    
    
